  "content": "<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14941\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/k3f247fkz78d02n/dsc_5903_1024x682_mq5qlgf880.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durante la jornada de este lunes, la Comisión Provincial Llanquihue del Consejo Regional de Los Lagos analizó diversas iniciativas de interés para las comunas de la provincia.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Entre ellas se encuentra el proyecto correspondiente al XXVII Festival de Canto Retro Maullín 2027, tradicional evento cultural de nuestra comuna que busca avanzar en su proceso de evaluación.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La sesión también contempló la presentación de otras iniciativas y requerimientos de municipios y organizaciones de la provincia.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🎤\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f3a4.png\"/><img alt=\"🎼\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcc/1/16/1f3bc.png\"/> Maullín continúa trabajando para proyectar una nueva versión de su tradicional Festival Retro.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/festivalretro?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#FestivalRetro</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/cultura?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Cultura</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/coreloslagos?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#CORELosLagos</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/provinciadellanquihue?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#ProvinciaDeLlanquihue</a></p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14925\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/zkr9xn6r0qb8pd8/dsc_0552_1024x678_t7gp4sv6d7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-31 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14924\" data-id=\"14924\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/g0bi2zj51bgozl7/dsc_0481_1024x683_meyu9zb3pk.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-